# Mortgage Hub has no settings of its own. The aityx ones are in the
# repository's root .env (see ../.env.example): the index server's dev key,
# and the key scripts/model-test.sh and scripts/aityx-check.sh use. In the
# browser the app uses the key you set on the index page ("Your aityx
# key"), else the index server's dev key; none is ever compiled into it.
# A .env here is still read by scripts/aityx-check.sh, for this demo only.
